{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-18_beg",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-18",
  "title": "列王行跡",
  "storyCode": "14-20",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-18_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b47ae305fddd13593a45953bed469827f8411d92f503bb8566fe98ee718bd7b3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "宇宙……什麼宇宙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "text": "你們所熟知的語言中並不包括這個詞語。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "text": "它是遠比天空與大地還要廣闊的概念，是所有的時間與空間，以及被它所包含的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "text": "即便是最傲慢的“神明”都不該宣稱自己能夠掌握宇宙的全部。因為這個詞語本身就象徵著無窮的邊界，以及時刻變化的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "text": "但是，源石會將這一切悉數納入，在其內部形成一個“內化宇宙”——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "停。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "總之，兩件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "一、不知道什麼原因，我們跟著飛空艇一頭扎進了源石裡面——天知道為什麼小小的石頭裡面居然會有這麼寬敞的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "二、我們還沒死，不知道以什麼方式還活在源石內部的，“宇宙”裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "text": "……可以這麼理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "嗯？什麼反應都沒有，連個泡都沒冒嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "text": "W小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "text": "剛剛你扔出去的……呃，是炸彈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "不然呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "我總得摸索一下。你就當炸彈是我的手好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "老女人說我們被關在源石裡了，說不定我碰到了邊界，順便炸出個——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "——剛剛怎麼回事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "就好像……有東西拉了我一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "底下那黃色的東西是液態源石嗎？炸彈炸到什麼玩意了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "text": "炸彈並未引爆，因為缺乏能量反應條件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "text": "在這片源石海中，我完全感知不到源石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "text": "……或許可以理解，畢竟外部的源石皆是以與其他物質結合的形式存在，亦必須符合外部“宇宙”的規則。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "text": "而此處的源石，即是規則本身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "text": "你這話還不如老女人說的好懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "text": "我們已進入另一套語法之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "text": "我能察覺到這片源石海洋中包含的……語言。浩瀚，磅礴，無邊無際。我目前尚不能徹底解析。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "text": "停下來，Logos。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "text": "至少在此時此地，別再嘗試去理解這“語言”。我們不能過多……擾動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "text": "雖然我們很可能已在危險的注視之下，但這艘船被允許存在，就證明我們暫時是安全的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "羅德島？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "船和源石海……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "這艘羅德島……是因你而存在，Dr.{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "我們本應被源石同化，成為這片海洋的一部分。是你救了我們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "你修改……不，重新制定了部分規則。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "在你自己都沒有察覺的情況下，你使用了那種“語言”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "剛剛我說的那種嗎？可我不記得了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "它好像在我腦子裡，好像不在。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
          "text": "哈？這傢伙還有這種能耐？你不會想告訴我，船上那些莫名其妙的場景，也都是這傢伙的一場夢吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
          "text": "那“溫暖人心”的幻想可真是……噁心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我也不喜歡。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
          "text": "……呵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "W轉過頭去，略帶思索地看向前方。\n在進入內化宇宙後，她的視線就很少落在你身上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
          "text": "問題的關鍵來了，我們撞進了這片源石裡面，還有沒有辦法出去？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
          "text": "這艘裝滿了幽靈的船，準備帶我們去什麼地方？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "羅德島航行在金色的海洋上。水面看起來毫無漣漪，更像是一面純金色的鏡子。\n一個疑問突然擊中了你——你們真的在航行嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "海面好像是靜止的……所有東西都是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "太安靜了，我什麼都感覺不到。流動的情感，充實的記憶……全部消失了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "凱爾希醫生，這裡是源石的內部，不是嗎？源石明明吞噬了那麼多東西……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "毀於天災的城市，死於礦石病的人……所有生命存在過的痕跡，它們不該都在這片海洋裡嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "為什麼……這裡什麼都沒有？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "因為這裡是……盡頭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "萬物盡數被源石封存，無法改變，也不會毀滅的盡頭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
          "text": "真棒啊，一個連死都不會死的“好”去處，拉特蘭都沒這麼神聖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
          "text": "難怪船上沒有薩卡茲。這麼溫馨甜蜜的好地方，怎麼可能——容得下我們這種妖魔鬼怪？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "……沒有薩卡茲？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "好像確實是這樣……從剛才開始，除了W小姐和Logos先生，的確沒有見到任何一個薩卡茲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "薩卡茲……與源石緊密相連的薩卡茲，都去了哪裡？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "船撞上了什麼……？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "海面上有東西？！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
          "text": "“看見”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“薩卡茲”",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "這些影子，是薩卡茲！他們正在——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
          "text": "——行軍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
          "text": "戰爭始終在繼續，無論在外面的戰場上，還是在這裡……亦無論是活著，還是死去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "水面上出現無數薩卡茲的影子。\n溫迪戈，炎魔，食腐者，女妖……以及許多被時間磨滅的古老氏族。\n他們有的拿著棍棒長槍，有的拿著弓弩長劍，有的背靠巫術火炮。\n水面是靜止的，而這些身影構成洪流，向前奔湧而去。\n衝鋒。廝殺。\n永不止歇。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
          "text": "戰爭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
          "text": "薩卡茲與萬物之間的戰爭，持續萬年，從未結束。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
          "text": "原來，這即是，薩卡茲的眾魂歸處。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
          "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
          "text": "羅德島本艦就在前面了，撐下去！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜鶯",
          "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
          "text": "（沉重的喘息）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
          "text": "我——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
          "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
          "text": "閃靈？你怎麼了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
          "text": "……那扇門已經打開。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
          "text": "死與生的距離，前所未有地近。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
          "text": "所有的薩卡茲，都能聽見。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "扛住這一輪衝擊！飛空艇被源石吞噬，王庭術師暫時管不到這裡！這是我們唯一的機會，脊椎的損傷太大了——\n赫德雷？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
          "text": "我聽見了……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
          "text": "巨獸又對你說話了？說什麼了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
          "text": "不……是另一個聲音……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
          "text": "……我聽見，歷史中所有的戰爭，都在同時進行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
          "text": "維娜，你看！倫蒂尼姆上面——那坨紅色的東西是不是又變大了？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
          "text": "不只變大了，而且紅得發黑。"
        },
        {
